.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_namespaces" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_namespaces" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_namespaces \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive - List Exported Namespaces
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_namespaces
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u32 nsid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_ns_list *list "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "nsid" 12
Return Exported Namespaces associated with this Exported NVM
Subsystem, with an Exported Namespace Identifier greater
than this value
.IP "list" 12
User address to store the Exported Namespace List data
structure, see \fIstruct nvme_exported_ns_list\fP
.IP "len" 12
The allocated length of \fIlist\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported NVM
Subsystem Receive command with SEL value
NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_NVMS_RECV_SEL_LIST_NAMESPACES.
